# The site is fully static and currently needs NO environment variables.
# This file exists as a template for later. Never commit a real .env file.
#
# If you later connect the contact form to a CRM / email service, keep secrets
# on a server-side function (e.g. a Vercel Serverless Function in /api), never
# in js/app.js or index.html:
#
# CRM_API_KEY=
# EMAIL_SERVICE_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
